 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Explaining a problem",
     "texto": [
      "**Bestilling** is an order; **pakke**, a package. **Mangle** means something is missing and **ødelagt**, that it is broken."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for a solution",
     "texto": [
      "To ask for help, you can **kontakte kundeservice** («contact customer service») and give the **ordrenummer** («order number»). **Sende en ny vare** means to send a new item."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
